  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1.4. Strengthened social dialogue and labour relations laws, processes and institutions</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">High level tripartite social dialogue has been strengthened, leading to  consensus on COVID response policies to support businesses. Labour and employment, including safe return to the work; ILO provided knowledge and technical support to constituents on response measures in other countries, shared Covid response tools developed by the ILO and capacity building of constituents on issues under social dialogue such as working time arrangements, OSH, wage protection, employment &amp; social protection, dispute prevention and resolution practices (mediation, workplace consultations and cooperation arrangements and grievance handling).</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.4.1. Number of member States with newly developed or strengthened institutions, mechanisms or regulatory frameworks for social dialogue, labour relations or dispute prevention/resolution that address current and emerging challenges in the world of work</narrative>
    </title>
